tyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; - 산업대학원 무논문과정<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2010-2학기 졸업종합시험 응시자 중 과목별 불합격자이며<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;3. 시험과목 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 석사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 과목</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 86.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -86.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 응시 과목 : 졸업종합시험은 동일 교수의 과목 만으로 시행할 수 없으며,<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; 반드시 출제교수가 2명 이상이어야 함.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;4. 시험 장소</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 추후 공지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMI